OL,3,GNEWSANew pipe ready to be installed
OL,4,Aafter sewage issue
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe replacement section of a damaged
OL,7,Fpipe that led to raw sewage being
OL,8,Fpumped into the sea has now been moved
OL,9,Ffor installation, a utility company has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FGuernsey Water removed the problematic
OL,13,Fpipe part at Fort George after drone
OL,14,Ffilm footage from the BBC revealed it
OL,15,Fwas discharging sewage too close to the
OL,16,Fshore in Soldier's Bay.
OL,18,FThe company has since created a new
OL,19,Fsection of piping which it has moved to
OL,20,Fthe harbour ready for installation.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
