OL,3,GNEWSANew pipe ready to be installed
OL,4,Aafter sewage issue
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt noted due to challenging conditions,
OL,7,FGuernsey Ports' dive team will only be
OL,8,Fable install the new part during a
OL,9,F"narrow tide and weather window". This
OL,10,Fis expected to take place in "the next
OL,11,Ffew weeks".
